          "text": "Today we remember Alexei #Navalny, leader of the Russian opposition, who was found dead in his prison cell in Siberia one year ago today.\nHaving been previously poisoned with the Novichok nerve agent and as well as being persecuted by Putin's regime, Navalny's death sparked protests and demonstrations around the world.\nWe stand in solidarity with Yulia Navalnaya and with Russians striving to put an end to Putin's authoritarian rule, and fighting for democracy."
